Notes:

Students are urged to acquaint themselves with the requirements of the major department in the college or university to which transfer is contemplated; and further, students are urged to consult with their counselors and advisors at VHCC in planning their academic program and electives.

 1. See UCGS Block II, parts A & B. Cannot be a literature course.

